==Battleground==
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*4 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sakura (Enemy)|Sakura]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

